---- ok
-STATEMENT DROP TABLE City
---- ok
-STATEMENT CREATE NODE TABLE city(id INT32, name STRING, population INT64, PRIMARY KEY(id)) WITH (storage = '${LBUG_ROOT_DIRECTORY}/dataset/demo-db/icebug-disk', format = 'icebug-disk')
---- ok
-STATEMENT MATCH (c:city) RETURN count(*)
